      "When checked, IPH will refresh average and adjusted market prices (if cache date has past) on startup for use in industry calcuations",
      "When checked, IPH will refresh blueprints (if cache date has past) for the selected character",
      "When checked, IPH will refresh data on public structures (if cache date has past) for use in price updates",
